## C. 最终 Canonical Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph WRITE[写入层]
      W1[distiller/hotspots/imports] --> API[Canonical Memory API]
      W2[cognitive.user_model] --> UM[(user_model)]
      W3[cognitive.episodic] --> EP[(episodes)]
      W4[knowledge_runtime] --> KN[(knowledge/*.md)]
    end
    API --> M[(memories 唯一 Canonical Store)]
    M --> GOV[memory_evolution 治理门面]
    GOV --> RET[DefaultEvolutionPolicy 唯一检索]
    GOV --> LC[lifecycle 状态机]
    RET --> CE[context.facade 唯一装配]
    LC --> EB[(EventBus 唯一事件)]
    KN --> CE
    CE --> LLM[LLM Prompt]
    style M fill:#1f5f3a,color:#fff
    style RET fill:#5f3a1f,color:#fff
    style CE fill:#3a1f5f,color:#fff
    style EB fill:#1f3a5f,color:#fff
```

**五权威，各一：**
1. Memory Store：`memories` + `memory_evolution` 门面
2. Retrieval：`DefaultEvolutionPolicy`
3. Context Assembly：`context.facade.build_context_prompt`
4. Knowledge：`knowledge_runtime`（文件，非 RAG）
5. Lifecycle/Event：`memory_evolution.lifecycle` + `eventbus`

